{"about_the_game":"The time of prophecy has come. When reality itself is threatened, the chosen hero begins a journey. What is that hero's name?<br><br><strong>Names are power:</strong> Everyone in the world can namesummon, which means ripping letters out of one's own name and using them as weapons, shields, and tools. Each letter has a different function. With 26 possible abilities, there are practically endless combinations.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weaponized Words</h2>You'll encounter many monsters and foes during your quest. Each can be defeated in a variety of ways, so be creative in how you use your name.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/combat_compressed.gif?t=1735415550\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Logical Letters</h2>Names have utility beyond combat. Solve puzzles and navigate past obstacles. No matter which name you pick, there is always a way to move forward.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/pressure_plate_2.gif?t=1735415550\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Text for Treasure</h2>The Universe is full of secrets and artifacts that may help you during your journey. Build your collection as you explore the Universe's bounds (and beyond).<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/impossible_cube_7.gif?t=1735415550\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Weird World</h2>Meet and befriend eccentric characters. Make impactful choices, and see the different directions this story can take.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2428450/extras/dialogue.gif?t=1735415550\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2428450?t=1735415550","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2428450?t=1735415550","capsule_image":"https://sh